<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - Jan 10.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - Jan 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   111/113   118/120     UNQ     233/235</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  118/120   123/126   238/242   248/255</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS -  Bunker eased further on Friday on continued thin enquiries and weak cargo levels, traders. Shipowners were very relax, taking it easy ahead of the weekend, they said. Most would cover requirements later, confident of further price slips, a trader said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
